


   =====( GuiMod V1.00 )=============================================


        Trion GUI ClickIt Utility.

        (c) Copyright Paul Spijkerman, '96-'97. All rights reserved.

        Written for use with the Trion BBS package.


   ===================================================================


   The programm called GuiMod is a more versatile version of
   the clickit tools.

   It has a better looking GUI, is uses 3 windows instead of 2.
   It has more buttons.
   It removes itself after you click on the down button.
   You can change the Editors and Viewers by changing the
   names in Stringgadgets which are saved when you quit the tool.
   It uses the Trion GUI lib instead of the gadtools lib.

   The GUI windows of GuiMod are dynamic, you can resize
   them and they render them self using all the space in the window.
   The list with users becomes shorter or longer and the space
   between buttons and other GUI elements changes.
   Also GUI elements like buttons can change size to better use the
   window space .. This depends on what is usefull in Utilities.

   It has a window to give all kind of commands.
   It has a window to edit configs, users and files.
   It has a window to view logs.

